            "sid": "GEN 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baba ŵangu Naholi, Abulahamu anganga ŵenu, ni acinangolo ŵawo, ŵamlambilaga Mlungu jwawo jumope, Jwelejo ni jutalolecesye kuti jwalijose jwetuwe akusunga cilanga citulanganeci.” Myoyo Yakobo ŵalumbile mu lina lya Mlungu jwele Isaki baba ŵawo ŵamjogopaga, kuti tacisunje cele cilangaci. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
