        {
          "text": "Kundaŵindaŵipe, pa kwacele, Labani ŵajimwice ni ŵalanjile ŵanace ŵawo ŵacakongwe ni yisukulu yawo yila, nipo ali ŵapele upile ŵatyosile ni kuwujila kumangwawo.",
